{"thread":{"threadID":3129,"boardID":166,"topic":"Mapvorschläge [CS:GO Jail]","time":1446650663,"userID":null,"username":"KAMIKATZE","lastPostTime":1448041980,"lastPoster":"Bara","replies":8,"views":814,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":2},"tags":[{"tagID":28,"name":"jail"},{"tagID":235,"name":"map"},{"tagID":89,"name":"maps"},{"tagID":212,"name":"vorschläge"}],"posts":[{"postID":40071,"threadID":3129,"userID":null,"username":"KAMIKATZE","subject":"Mapvorschläge [CS:GO Jail]","time":1446650663,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","time":1446652300,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1446667693,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey liebe Community .<br>Ich habe im Internet neue Maps für den Jail Server recherchiert da es nicht<br>so viel Spaß macht immer die gleichen Maps zu spielen .  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😣</span> <br>Mir persönlich gefallen die Maps vom aussehen her . Wäre echt gut wenn<br>man mal paar neue Maps spielen könnte .  <span class=\"missing-media\">[8o]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Links :<br><a href=\"http://csgo.gamebanana.com/maps/186452\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://csgo.gamebanana.com/maps/186219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://csgo.gamebanana.com/maps/187909\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><a href=\"http://csgo.gamebanana.com/maps/187478\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40072,"threadID":3129,"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","subject":"","time":1446651068,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kommt immer gut wenn du nen paar Screens mit reinhaust, dann kann man sich die maps mal anschauen ohne sie runterladen zu müssen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40073,"threadID":3129,"userID":1525,"username":"Benni","subject":"","time":1446651188,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1446655618,"value":1},{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1446655732,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Basti</strong></cite><p>Kommt immer gut wenn du nen paar Screens mit reinhaust, dann kann man sich die maps mal anschauen ohne sie runterladen zu müssen.<br></p></blockquote><p>Auf gamebanana sind doch immer screens dabei <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😬</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40075,"threadID":3129,"userID":null,"username":"Zeschter","subject":"","time":1446657641,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1446667696,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Die Idee gefällt mir sehr gut. Vielleicht auch mal die existierenden Dream Maps editieren.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40084,"threadID":3129,"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","subject":"","time":1446667683,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1446704655,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Zeschterer</strong></cite><p>Die Idee gefällt mir sehr gut. Vielleicht auch mal die existierenden Dream Maps editieren.<br></p></blockquote><p>Find die Idee von Zescht gut!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Und die Idee von <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1973-kamikaze61/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@KAMIKAZE61</a> aber auch, da es wirklich langweilig wird jedes mal die gleichen Maps zu spielen. Nur sollte man drauf achten, dass wenn man neue Maps holt, sie nicht irgendwelche Bugs haben oder einfach nur langweilig bzw. man dort keinen Spielspaß hat.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40085,"threadID":3129,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1446667839,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Finde die Idee gut, aber von den Screens her sind die alle nicht sooooooooooo Bombe</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40098,"threadID":3129,"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","subject":"","time":1446704827,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1446711904,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sehr gut. Nur die maps bitte nochmal anschauen da es nicht immer so geil ist mehrere fast gleiche maps zu haben. Aber es gibt auch extrem gute maps von denen wir noch keine Version aufm jail haben also wenn jemand ne gute map findet und die aufm Server kommt, bekommt er nen Euro von mir. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40159,"threadID":3129,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"","time":1446746754,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1962,"username":"Kentox","time":1446747343,"value":1},{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1446755205,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1446853467,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Mangaroons, Atomic und MILG werden den beiden Jail Servern soeben hinzugefügt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>BlackFire</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":40796,"threadID":3129,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1448041980,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Um nur mal dich und allen anderen drauf aufmerksam zu machen, es gibt eine eigene Unter-Kategorie für Vorschläge. -&gt; <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?board/167-plugin-map-allgemeine-vorschl%C3%A4ge/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">PlugIn / Map / Allgemeine Vorschläge</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>2. Admin Fail</p>","polls":[]}]}